  "result": "Bulk discount feature is complete and all 387 tests pass! Here's what was implemented:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n**src/totals.js:**\n- Added `lineBulkDiscount()` function that applies a 2.5% discount for lines with qty \u2265 10, calculated on the amount remaining after the line's own discount\n- Modified `lineVAT()` to account for both line discount and bulk discount in the taxable amount\n- Updated `invoiceTotals()` to sum both line and bulk discounts into the total discount field\n\n**src/invoices.js:**\n- Re-exported `lineBulkDiscount` for backward compatibility\n\n**test/totals.test.js:**\n- Added 16 comprehensive tests for bulk discount functionality covering:\n  - No bulk discount for qty < 10\n  - Bulk discount applied for qty \u2265 10\n  - Bulk discount interaction with line discounts\n  - Bulk discount with tier discounts\n  - VAT calculation including bulk discount\n  - Multiple lines with different quantities\n\n**Test Suite Updates:**\n- Fixed all existing tests to work with the new bulk discount behavior\n- Updated expected values where qty \u2265 10 invoices now receive bulk discount\n- Changed some test data from qty 10/100 to qty 9 to avoid triggering bulk discount in tests not specifically testing that feature\n\n**Result:** All 387 tests passing \u2713",
